# ===========================================================================
# Docker build context exclusions
#
# Build context is the repo root (docker build -f packages/twenty-docker/twenty/Dockerfile .)
# Goal: keep the context small (faster cold/warm builds, less cache invalidation)
# and ensure no secrets are ever sent to the daemon or baked into a layer.
#
# IMPORTANT: do not exclude any source the Dockerfile COPYs. The build needs the
# source of: twenty-server, twenty-front, twenty-front-component-renderer,
# twenty-ui, twenty-ui-deprecated, twenty-shared, twenty-sdk, twenty-client-sdk,
# twenty-emails (plus root config, .yarn/releases, .yarn/patches and
# packages/twenty-server/patches).
# ===========================================================================

# --- Version control / CI metadata ---
.git
.gitignore
.github
.husky

# --- Dependencies (rebuilt in-container via `yarn workspaces focus`) ---
**/node_modules

# --- Nx cache and daemon state (rebuilt in-container) ---
.nx

# --- Secrets: never send any real .env into the context or a build layer ---
# (the Dockerfile's broad `COPY ./packages/<pkg>` lines would otherwise bake
#  package-level .env files into intermediate layers)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# --- Incremental TypeScript build state (never a build input) ---
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Local build output (rebuilt in-container) ---
# Exclude all package dist/ EXCEPT twenty-ui/dist, which ships committed
# theme CSS the frontend build relies on (verified via `git ls-files`: it is the
# only committed dist/). packages/twenty-front/build is left intact so the
# Dockerfile can reuse a host-prebuilt frontend.
**/dist
!packages/twenty-ui/dist
!packages/twenty-ui/dist/**

# Yarn install-state is regenerated and never copied by the Dockerfile
# (only .yarn/releases and .yarn/patches are copied).
.yarn/install-state.gz
.yarn/cache

# --- Test / coverage / report artifacts (not needed to build the image) ---
**/coverage
**/storybook-static
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.vitest

# --- Packages never referenced by this Dockerfile (no COPY targets them) ---
packages/twenty-docs
packages/twenty-website
packages/twenty-companion
packages/twenty-apps
packages/twenty-cli
packages/create-twenty-app
packages/twenty-e2e-testing
packages/twenty-zapier
packages/twenty-utils
packages/twenty-codex-plugin
packages/twenty-oxlint-rules
packages/twenty-claude-skills

# --- Editor / OS noise ---
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
.vscode
.idea
*.swp

# --- Logs and stray files ---
**/*.log
nul
